OL,3,APolice question Steve Wright about
OL,4,Aunsolved cases
OL,5,
OL,6,FSerial killer Steve Wright has been
OL,7,Fquestioned about a series of cold cases
OL,8,Fbut is "not currently a suspect" in any
OL,9,Fof them, the police have told the BBC.
OL,11,FThe 68-year-old was jailed for life in
OL,12,F2008 for the murders of five women in
OL,13,FIpswich between October and December
OL,14,F2006.
OL,16,FIn February, he was given a further
OL,17,Flife sentence after pleading guilty to
OL,18,Fthe kidnap and killing of 17-year-old
OL,19,FVictoria Hall, from Trimley St Mary, in
OL,20,FSeptember 1999.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
