OL,3,APolice question Steve Wright about
OL,4,Aunsolved cases
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk Police said his admissions
OL,7,Fprompted the force to consider whether
OL,8,FWright may have been involved in other
OL,9,Funsolved disappearances or murders.
